# LingBot env-scan orientation — protected

Read `memory-bank/lingbot-env-scan-orientation-protected-state.md` before editing gravity, metric scale, or 3DGS refine.

## Order (required)

1. Gravity → +Y (reject inverted camera-up; prefer floor when unreliable)
2. Y-flip if densest slab is ceiling
3. Seat Y=0
4. X-mirror (left↔right)
5. Horizontal door scale only when fixing width (`axis: horizontal`)

## Forbidden

- Trusting camera-up near world −Y without flip
- Uniform Y scale for door-width calibration
- Dropping X-mirror or densest-slab Y-flip
